# FILSYS LIST-FILE-NAMES regression (the 24-AUG-2026 runaway repro).
# Assumes a freshly reset board at the OPCOM '#' prompt.
FAILON o update and check directories
LABEL boot FILSYS from tape
SEND 400&
EXPECT 40 File System Investigator
EXPECT 10 Device name
SEND FLOPPY-DISC-1
SENDCR
EXPECT 10 Device unit
SEND 0
SENDCR
EXPECT 20 Total no\. of disk pages is 001150
EXPECT 10 >
LABEL LIST-FILE-NAMES bare-CR answer (the 20-second repro)
SEND LIST-FILE-NAMES
SENDCR
EXPECT 10 User no\.
SENDCR
EXPECT 60 0041 UNIVERS-DMA-C02
EXPECT 10 >
LABEL prompt must be idle (no runaway reprint)
QUIET 8
LABEL LIST-USERS still healthy
SEND LIST-USERS
SENDCR
EXPECT 20 FLOPPY-USER
EXPECT 10 >
QUIET 5
